^(asks\ before\ an\ edit\ in\ default\ mode\ and\ runs\ the\ batch\ once\ the\ owner\ allows|refuses\ a\ denied\ call\ in\ the\ model\ order\ and\ still\ runs\ the\ rest|commits\ only\ refusals\ when\ every\ asked\ call\ is\ denied|honors\ .*?\ approval\ for\ an\ MCP\ call\ while\ retaining\ its\ shared\ owner|asks\ one\ call\ at\ a\ time\ in\ the\ model\ order|expires\ an\ approval\ that\ is\ answered\ after\ its\ expiry|cancels\ a\ waiting\ approval\ and\ refuses\ every\ call\ when\ the\ turn\ aborts|refuses\ an\ Action\ response\ that\ does\ not\ match\ the\ request|keeps\ an\ answer\ retryable\ when\ it\ fails\ before\ any\ write|stops\ the\ Turn\ when\ a\ late\ answer\ cannot\ record\ the\ expiry|stops\ a\ waiting\ Turn\ soon\ after\ another\ write\ stops\ the\ Session|answers\ what\ a\ blocked\ Session\ already\ recorded\ but\ writes\ nothing|keeps\ a\ decision\ that\ lands\ just\ before\ the\ waiter\ ends\ the\ Action|reports\ an\ answer\ that\ loses\ the\ race\ to\ the\ expiry\ as\ expired|blocks\ recovery\ when\ a\ refusal\ record\ write\ fails|does\ not\ ask\ about\ later\ calls\ once\ the\ turn\ is\ cancelled|asks\ before\ Shell\ in\ auto\-edit\ mode\ and\ runs\ the\ edit\ when\ Shell\ is\ denied|writes\ nothing\ once\ the\ Turn\ blocks\ during\ an\ answer|replays\ a\ decision\ recorded\ while\ the\ answer\ was\ being\ read|answers\ two\ identical\ concurrent\ decisions\ alike|answers\ the\ same\ decision\ that\ won\ a\ race\ while\ it\ was\ being\ written|answers\ the\ loser\ of\ two\ different\ concurrent\ decisions\ with\ a\ conflict|writes\ nothing\ once\ the\ Turn\ blocks\ while\ the\ decision\ is\ published|answers\ what\ landed\ while\ the\ decision\ was\ published,\ even\ once\ blocked|writes\ nothing\ when\ the\ Session\ blocks\ while\ the\ .*?\ waits\ in\ the\ queue|runs\ PreToolUse\ after\ approval\ and\ asks\ again\ for\ changed\ arguments|honors\ a\ top\-level\ PreToolUse\ ask\ before\ a\ preapproved\ call\ \(.*?\)|restores\ PreToolUse\ context\ from\ its\ durable\ receipt\ without\ duplicate\ effects\ \(.*?,\ oversized:\ .*?\))
